{
  "name": "theta-h6-dispersion",
  "notes": "PRE-REGISTERED H6 (ADR-0265, Amendment 5), development period 2016-01-04 .. 2021-01-01 (end_before; nothing on or after 2026-01-01 is read). ADR RULE, verbatim: **H6** dispersion (index versus equal-weight basket of tested names; equal-weight proxy stated): correlation premium > 0, t >= 2.5 in both halves. COMMON (ADR-0265 decisions 1-4): Split. Development 2016-01-04..2020-12-31; validation 2021-01-04..2025-12-31, run once per hypothesis, unchanged, only if the development run passed; 2024-25 is a labelled subperiod, never the sole basis of a pass; 2026 stays sealed. Universe gate: a root enters a test only from its first date with bid > 0 (the census); roots are stitched across renames. Cost model: buy at the ask, sell at the bid (NBBO); no mid fills; `close` is never a mark; our own Black-76 implied vol from the mid and the parity forward. Multiple testing: Benjamini-Hochberg 5% within a hypothesis's feature family; Bonferroni across the families for any headline claim; secondary analyses are reported, never promoted. This is the development run. Run from children/index_options, niced, after the census, the universe freeze and the panel (ADR-0265 Amendment 5 run book): nice -n 10 python -m dskit.pipeline run configs/run-theta-h6-dispersion.json --asof 2025-12-31",
